flowchart TB
    Admin[Authenticated administrator<br/>MFA + CSRF] --> UI[Admin Backup Management]
    UI --> Preflight[Archive preflight<br/>gzip · allowlist · path/link safety<br/>manifest · checksums · DB payload]
    Preflight --> Confirm[Typed confirmation<br/>time-bound, administrator-bound]
    Confirm --> Socket[Fixed-action Unix socket request<br/>archive name and action allowlisted]
    Socket --> Root[Root backup / restore controller]
    Root --> Safety[Create safety snapshot<br/>retain prior target env root-only]
    Root --> Restore[Restore DB + storage + portable secrets]
    Restore --> Preserve[Preserve target identity<br/>hostname · origins · DB connection<br/>network · storage path · TLS · SAML activation]
    Preserve --> Migrate[Run forward migrations<br/>and schema contract]
    Migrate --> Ready{Readiness passes?}
    Ready -->|Yes| Record[Append-only root-owned recovery history<br/>completed]
    Ready -->|No| Failure[Append-only root-owned recovery history<br/>failed with safe diagnostic]
    Record --> Signin[Sessions invalidated; sign in again]

    classDef control fill:#EAF5F3,stroke:#2A9D8F,color:#0D2036;
    classDef root fill:#FAECEC,stroke:#B54141,color:#4A1616;
    classDef success fill:#EAF6EC,stroke:#43885A,color:#1E4D2B;
    classDef failure fill:#FAECEC,stroke:#B54141,color:#4A1616;
    class Admin,UI,Preflight,Confirm,Socket,Preserve,Migrate control;
    class Root,Safety,Restore root;
    class Record,Signin success;
    class Failure failure;
